  "description": "High-performance, pure managed C# arbitrary-precision arithmetic: big integers and rationals plus correctly-rounded arbitrary-precision floating point (five rounding modes, NaN/Inf/signed zero, elementary and transcendental functions), plus allocation-free fixed-width floats: IEEE 754 binary128 (Float128, correctly rounded) and double-double / quad-double (DoubleDouble, QuadDouble). SIMD-accelerated with portable fallbacks, no native dependencies.",
